SUMMARY:Glen Ridge Repair Cafe
DESCRIPTION:Don’t despair – REPAIR! At the Glen Ridge Repair Cafe. \nGive your stuff a new life and keep it out of the waste stream. Our talented repairers can fix: \n*small appliances & furniture\n*electronics\n*computers\n*fabrics (patching\, buttons\, moth damage\, seams\, upholstery\, & stuffed animals – no tailoring)\n*lamps \nPlus knife\, scissor\, and garden shear sharpening \nRepairs are free; donations are welcome. Drop off items between 10 and noon; pick up by 2 pm. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
