SUMMARY:North Jersey Modern Quilt Guild meeting Sat Nov 7th
DESCRIPTION:The North Jersey Modern Quilt guild\, a regional chapter of the Modern Quilt Guild\, will meet from 10a – 12p on Saturday November 7th at the Community Church of Cedar Grove. We are a friendly\, diverse group of quilters — supporting experts and beginners of all ages and backgrounds. We sew for fun and charity\, hold workshops\, swaps and challenges to stretch our skills\, and share our work. We welcome visitors and new members\, so come to a meeting and see what we’re all about! See our webpage for more info: njmqg.com \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/north-jersey-modern-quilt-guild-meeting-sat-nov-7th/
