SUMMARY:Art in Nature Day at Van Vleck
DESCRIPTION:Saturday November 7th\, 10AM – 12PM (rain date November 8th) \nSpend an afternoon in the gardens of Van Vleck enjoying various nature inspired art projects. Outdoor stations will include activities such as painting with natural objects\, nature sketching\, nature collages and more. Families and individuals of all ages (3 yrs. & up) and abilities are welcome. Materials will be included\, and no art experience is necessary.\nFee: Families: $20/family for Members; $30/family for General Public.\nIndividuals: $10/person for Members; $15/person for General Public.\nPlease register at the link. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/art-in-nature-day-at-van-vleck/
LOCATION:Van Vleck House & Gardens\, 21 Van Vleck Street\, Montclair\, NJ\, 07042\, United States
CATEGORIES:Kids & Families
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/VV-TMF-Art-in-Nature-2026_-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
