SUMMARY:Scout Day - Natural Crafting
DESCRIPTION:November 7\, 1:00 PM – 2:30 PM\nCalling all scout troops! Create beautiful artwork together inspired by nature. Activities support various art themed badges for each girl scout level. This program is held outdoors\, weather permitting\, indoors in inclement weather. Please read the full registration details on the website to sign up. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
