SUMMARY:The Great Pumpkin Smash
DESCRIPTION:IT’S A SMASHING GOOD TIME \nOne of our most-beloved events\, the Pumpkin Smash returns Sunday\, November 8. \nAmericans buy one BILLION pounds of pumpkins for the Halloween season. Instead of throwing them in the trash\, have fun tossing\, smooshing\, and shattering those gourds and sending them off for composting. It is a seriously smashing good time! \n*$5 suggested donation\n*Pumpkins must be free of decorations — no glue\, paint\, glitter\, googly eyes\, wax\, and candles\, etc. \nSponsored by the Glen Ridge Environmental Advisory Committee. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/the-great-pumpkin-smash/
LOCATION:Benson Street Green\, 76 Benson St. @ Wildwood Terrace\, Glen Ridge\, 07028\, United States
CATEGORIES:Community
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Pumpkin-smash-2026.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Glen Ridge Environmental Advisory Committee":MAILTO:goglenridgegreen@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
