SUMMARY:Mini Holiday Photo Session
DESCRIPTION:The $95.00 session fee includes a 15 minute photo shoot and 1 hi-res fully- retouched file in time for Holiday cards & gifts. You will have option to purchase additional files and prints. A gallery of selects will be emailed with info on how to choose your file\, etc. Holiday backdrop is perfect for all winter celebrations\, dress up\, or bring props! Candy canes & Hanukkah gelt will be on hand to keep the smiles going. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
