SUMMARY:RAMP'D UP live at Montclair Brewery
DESCRIPTION:Hailing from East Rutherford\, NJ\, RAMP’D UP is a high-energy cover band bringing the biggest hits of the 80s\, 90s\, and 2000s back to life! Blending iconic rock anthems\, alternative favorites\, and Top 40 hits\, RAMP’D UP delivers an electrifying live experience that keeps audiences singing\, dancing\, and rocking all night long. From nostalgic throwbacks to crowd-pleasing anthems\, every performance is a celebration of great music and unforgettable memories. Whether you’re a die-hard rock fan or just looking for a great night out\, RAMP’D UP is ready to turn up the volume and bring the party! \n$5 cover charge per person that goes directly to the artists. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/rampd-up-live-at-montclair-brewery/
LOCATION:Montclair Brewery\, 101 Walnut Street\, Montclair\, NJ\, 07042\, United States
CATEGORIES:Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/RAMPD-UP.jpeg
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Brewery":MAILTO:Staff@montclairbrewery.com
END:VEVENT
