SUMMARY:Beyond the Buzz: Managing AI’s Human\, Cyber\, and Legal Challenges
DESCRIPTION:AI is quickly becoming part of everyday business\, and many small and mid-sized businesses are already experimenting with AI tools—often before formal policies or guidelines are in place. Leaders don’t need to slow innovation\, but they do need practical guardrails to protect data\, support employees\, and ensure AI adoption is aligned with business goals. \nThis NJBIA Business Growth Roundtable will give business leaders a practical starting point for navigating AI responsibly. Experts in cybersecurity\, law\, privacy\, and workforce leadership will share strategies for reducing risk\, developing effective policies\, and helping employees use AI thoughtfully and confidently. \nWhat We’ll Cover\nWhere informal AI use can create cybersecurity\, privacy\, compliance\, and data protection risks\nWhat leaders should consider before employees use AI tools in their day-to-day work\nHow practical policies\, employee training\, technical controls\, and clear communication can work together\nWhat SMB leaders can do in the next 30 days to move AI adoption forward responsibly \nWho Should Attend\nSolo professionals and small business owners already using or exploring AI tools\nSmall and mid-sized business leaders developing practical AI guardrails\nOperations\, HR\, legal\, IT\, and cybersecurity decision-makers\nLeaders responsible for employee training\, vendor management\, or data protection\nOrganizations looking to balance innovation with accountability\, security\, and employee readiness \nVirtual Event Registration:\nhttps://us02web.zoom.us/webinar/register/6217912946917/WN_Op7Tt98vSKuP79NNF9HX8w \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/beyond-the-buzz-managing-ais-human-cyber-and-legal-challenges/
LOCATION:Online – Virtual\, Montclair\, NJ\, 07042\, United States
CATEGORIES:Virtual Event
