SUMMARY:Roadblocks
DESCRIPTION:“Roadblocks\,” an exhibition that delves into the concept of the barriers—both physical and metaphorical—that shape our societies and lives as individuals. The works in this exhibit explore—with diversity and breadth–how roadblocks are constructed\, perceived\, and sometimes dismantled. 2D\, 3D\, photographic\, and digital artworks examine the ways in which the barriers in our lives often hinder connection\, understanding\, and progress and yet can ultimately foster positive growth. \nAugmenting this exhibit will be a thought-provoking Zoom Webinar on Wednesday\, November 18 at 7pm featuring guest speakers who will\, through selected artworks\, delve into the tangible and abstract barriers that shape our societies\, relationships\, and identities as individuals. Hosted by exhibit jurors Lisa D’Amico and Debbie Silberberg\, the conversation will feature special guest speakers Naomi Vladeck\, artists’ life coach\, and Jose Perez\, artist and psychotherapist. Viewers will be encouraged to participate in a dynamic conversation with presenters. To register\, go to https://tinyurl.com/roadblocksexhibit. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/roadblocks/
